    <string name="accessibility_service_label">Reward Ad Guard</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_summary">Watches only the reward apps you select and can return you to them if an ad opens an external app.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Reward Ad Guard uses the accessibility service to:\n\n1. Detect when one of YOUR selected reward apps is in the foreground.\n2. Detect when an ad leaves that app for a browser, store, game or deep link.\n3. Optionally return you to the reward app (BLOCK mode).\n4. Assist with ad [X] close buttons by detecting them and logging their bounds.\n\nIt never modifies the reward app, the ad SDK or the reward callback, and it stores only package names, event types and timestamps on this device.</string>

